### Use the VS Code "REST Client" extension, then click "Send Request" above each block.
### Run them top to bottom. Cookies (the refresh token) are remembered automatically.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000/api

### 1. Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. Login -> put YOUR admin email and password here
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{$dotenv ADMIN_EMAIL}}",
  "password": "ChangeMe123"
}

### (the access token from request 2 is reused below automatically)
@accessToken = {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### 3. Who am I? (protected route)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 4. Protected route WITHOUT a token -> should return 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me

### 5. Get a new access token using the refresh cookie
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh

### 6. Wrong password -> should return 401 "Invalid email or password"
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{$dotenv ADMIN_EMAIL}}",
  "password": "wrong-password1"
}

### 7. Invalid input -> should return 400 with field errors
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "not-an-email"
}

### 8. Change password (logs out other sessions, keeps this one)
# PUT {{baseUrl}}/auth/change-password
# Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
# Content-Type: application/json
#
# {
#   "currentPassword": "ChangeMe123",
#   "newPassword": "NewPassword456"
# }

### 9. Logout -> after this, request 5 (refresh) should fail with 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
### Create a skill
POST {{baseUrl}}/skills
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "React",
  "category": "Frontend",
  "level": 90
}
### All projects INCLUDING drafts (admin sees 3)
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Create a project (starts as a draft)
# @name newProject
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "My New Project",
  "summary": "Short description for the project card.",
  "techStack": ["React", "Node.js"],
  "liveUrl": "https://example.com"
}

###
@projectId = {{newProject.response.body.$.data._id}}

### Publish it (only the fields you send change)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "published"
}

### Delete it
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Update About
PUT {{baseUrl}}/about
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Farha",
  "headline": "Full-Stack Developer"
}

### Dashboard counts
GET {{baseUrl}}/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Validation error -> 400 with field messages
POST {{baseUrl}}/skills
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "level": 150
}

### ---------- Day 4: uploads & media library ----------
### Upload an image (put any .png next to this file and change the path)
# @name upload
POST {{baseUrl}}/upload/image
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=Boundary

--Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="alt"

My profile photo
--Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="photo.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./photo.png
--Boundary--

###
@mediaId = {{upload.response.body.$.data._id}}

### List images in the media library
GET {{baseUrl}}/media?kind=image
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Update alt text
PUT {{baseUrl}}/media/{{mediaId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "alt": "Updated alt text"
}

### Delete it (also removes the file from /uploads)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/media/{{mediaId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### ---------- Day 11: contact form ----------
### Send a message (public, max 5 per hour per IP)
POST {{baseUrl}}/contact
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Jane Visitor",
  "email": "jane@example.com",
  "subject": "Project enquiry",
  "message": "Hi! I saw your portfolio and would like to talk about a project."
}

### Invalid input -> 400 with field errors
POST {{baseUrl}}/contact
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "email": "not-an-email",
  "message": "short"
}

### Inbox: unread messages (admin)
# @name inbox
GET {{baseUrl}}/contact?read=false
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###
@messageId = {{inbox.response.body.$.data[0]._id}}

### Mark as read
PUT {{baseUrl}}/contact/{{messageId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "read": true
}

### Delete a message
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/contact/{{messageId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
